        "Details": "The original Fireball Extra Fast (XF) was built by a criminal who used it for illegal street races, mounting a 320XXL engine and both a supercharger and MASC it was able to reach speeds of over 400 KPH. The cost for that speed was that, the original had only two ER small lasers as token weaponry. This version is the personal 'Mech of Shimbol Shambag, one of the leaders of the Mongol splinter group of the Jade Falcons. Unlike the original XF, this one is designed for actual combat, and as such it has a slightly reduced power 260 XXL engine, but mounts a medium and small COIL laser to make use of the mech's absurd speed and evasion ability to maximum effect.",
